  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You brand your target nearly effortlessly—when you put your power behind it you can make the brand last much longer.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Branded for Retribution<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You need expend only one round of bane to brand a creature as a standard action, or you can brand a creature in place of a melee attack by expending two rounds of bane. If you expend one use of mythic power, the brand created by your strike lasts a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
